# Leading-slash-free patterns containing a slash are still anchored to this
# file's directory, so `tests/.auth/` never matched apps/web/tests/.auth/ and a
# Playwright storage state — a live session token — was committed.
**/tests/.auth/
**/test-results/
**/playwright-report/
